    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10418" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">con-saucĭo</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. a., to wound severely</i> (very rare): 
