				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Ner. 26 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">corpus crebro vulnere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Auct. Her. 4, 19, 26</span></i>
			.—With acc. of <i>part.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crus et utrumque bracchium ruinā
					pontis consauciatus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Aug. 20</span></i>
			.</div>
